   507	
   508	| LV §6 item | LV (d ≍ (log N)^{1/3}, heights L(1/3)) | here (fixed d, height N^{1/(4k)}) |
   509	|---|---|---|
   510	| |H| bound | Claim 6.5 via BLP Prop 7.4, √\|Δ_g\|(log n)^{O(d)} | Lemma H, 2^{dω(D)+d}h_K = N^{O(1)} |
