   513	| pigeonhole | ℓ = (4/3) log log n repetitions, (ℓ choose 2) tests | 3 tests |
   514	| square root | Montgomery "O(M²)", not analysed | Lemma SQ (BLP §9 made explicit), quasi-linear, rigorous |
