   518	Our proof uses LV §6's architecture: random large characters, Stark plus Landau, a pigeonhole on the residual
   519	kernel. It also uses BLP §§6, 8, 9 and 12 (obstruction chain, random-character idea, p-adic square root, non-monic
   520	parity). We supply the fixed-degree specialisation and the explicit bounds.
