   641	**Theorem A [conditional on Hypothesis LD only].**
   642	- **Parameters.**
   643	  - Fix odd d ≥ 7, an integer k > (d+1)/4 and η₀ > 0.
   644	  - Put s = 1/(d+1), h = max(1/(2k), s − (d−2)/(4k)) + η₀ and θ = 2s + (d−1)/(4k) + h.
   645	  - Assume θ < 1. Let a = θ/√2, B = L_N[1/2, a], and S² = (log N)^{C₃}/(ρ_rρ_F).
